        <item>
        <title>CSSZ Ski Day at Flumserberg 🎿🏔️</title>
        <link>https://cssz.ch/events/ski-day-flumserberg/</link>
        <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate>
        <guid>https://cssz.ch/events/ski-day-flumserberg/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/flumserberg-ski-map.png" alt="Featured image of post CSSZ Ski Day at Flumserberg 🎿🏔️" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us for an exciting ski day at Flumserberg, just 1 hour from Zurich! With 65 km of slopes and stunning panoramic views, Flumserberg is the perfect spot for a one-day ski adventure. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re a beginner or an expert, this is a great opportunity to hit the slopes and enjoy the snow with fellow students! ⛷️❄️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;meeting-point--travel&#34;&gt;Meeting Point &amp;amp; Travel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All participants must book their own tickets. We meet at &lt;strong&gt;6:50 AM at Zurich HB, Platform 8.&lt;/strong&gt; ⏰ Be on time! The train is often full, and it&amp;rsquo;s best to board early to get a seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;travel&#34;&gt;Travel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Train Zurich HB -&amp;gt; Flumserbeg:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;picture class=&#34;img&#34; style=&#34;background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAECAIAAAABPYjBAAAAjklEQVR4nFyOQQqEMAxFk1hHW7oUvP/hXMVVBIWkNgMtDjJvl5888gMzH8eRUlJVIlrXdds2bLh7SmlZFndHRHjRk3CeJzNP01RK&amp;#43;TT2fc85E5GZDcMAAH/mL0ERUVVEDCF0IcY4z/NzBn3r7m2CWmtp5JzDfd/9wziOiNgriMjjAhG9q5rZdV1mFmP8DgD4NFOEioTApAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==); background-size: cover; display: inline;&#34;&gt;
            &lt;source srcset=&#39;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train1_hu_8d6e546ee2c0d35f.webp 557w, https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train1_hu_8d6e546ee2c0d35f.webp 557w&#39;
                    sizes=&#34;(max-width: 557px) 100vw, 557px&#34;
                    type=&#34;image/webp&#34;
            /&gt;&lt;source srcset=&#39;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train1_hu_3813f6849a7dca3e.jpg 557w, https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train1_hu_3813f6849a7dca3e.jpg 557w&#39;
                    sizes=&#34;(max-width: 557px) 100vw, 557px&#34;
                    type=&#34;image/jpeg&#34;
            /&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train1_hu_3813f6849a7dca3e.jpg&#34;
                 width=&#34;557&#34;
                 height=&#34;124&#34;
                 
                 
                 
                 
            /&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Train Flumserbeg -&amp;gt; Zurich HB:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;picture class=&#34;img&#34; style=&#34;background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAECAIAAAABPYjBAAAAjUlEQVR4nGzOMQqEQAyF4XnhuaksPIGN9z&amp;#43;WgpWMwpjRkGXdtVn8yvATHpdlyTmTFBF3b9uW5DRNqgpg27ZhGEQkPWHOeRxHACml8zz7vic5z3PXdapqZnf5AOu61lpFBAAvx3G8Llfw&amp;#43;XjHP&amp;#43;7&amp;#43;PTIiSilN06hqRNRaAZhZKSWlFBF/myNi33czc/f3AIBRUE543bLzAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC); background-size: cover; display: inline;&#34;&gt;
            &lt;source srcset=&#39;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train2_hu_bdcc2b2cfa22172c.webp 542w, https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train2_hu_bdcc2b2cfa22172c.webp 542w&#39;
                    sizes=&#34;(max-width: 542px) 100vw, 542px&#34;
                    type=&#34;image/webp&#34;
            /&gt;&lt;source srcset=&#39;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train2_hu_d76d33be6213177c.jpg 542w, https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train2_hu_d76d33be6213177c.jpg 542w&#39;
                    sizes=&#34;(max-width: 542px) 100vw, 542px&#34;
                    type=&#34;image/jpeg&#34;
            /&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://cssz.ch/images/events/2025-03-08-ski-day-flumserberg/train2_hu_d76d33be6213177c.jpg&#34;
                 width=&#34;542&#34;
                 height=&#34;121&#34;
                 class=&#34;mb-4&#34;
                 
                 
                 
            /&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;booking--costs&#34;&gt;Booking &amp;amp; Costs&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you know that you are going to travel as a group of four and all of you are under 25 then you can buy the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.sbb.ch/en/tickets-offers/tickets/day-passes/friends-day-pass-youth.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Friends Day Pass for Youth&lt;/a&gt; instead of a regular train ticket.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Otherwise it cheaper to book via use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://freizeit.sbb.ch/en/stories/snownrail-flumserberg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Snow’n’Rail Flumserberg&lt;/a&gt; or individually - ca &lt;strong&gt;CHF 101 total&lt;/strong&gt; (CHF 29 for SBB return ticket + CHF 72 for a day ski pass).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;additional-information&#34;&gt;Additional information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skipass booking &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.flumserberg.ch/webshop&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;https://www.flumserberg.ch/webshop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SBB booking &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.sbb.ch/en&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;https://www.sbb.ch/en&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ski map:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
