        <description>&lt;img src="https://cssz.ch/images/events/2023-02-23-spring-bqm/image.imageformat.lightbox.25242075.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Semester Welcome Event (Spring 2025)" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us for a lively kick-off to the Spring semester 2025 at the bQm bar 🍻, where the Czech and Slovak Students in Zurich will meet up for a beer ⭐. This is a great opportunity for both new and existing students to meet 🤝. We look forward to seeing you there! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;
